1
00:06:43,636 --> 00:06:49,636
Anna and the King is a drama, romance, history film directed by Andy Tennant.

2
00:13:27,272 --> 00:13:33,272
The story of the romance between the King of Siam (now Thailand) and the
widowed British school teacher Anna Leonowens during the 1860s.

3
00:20:10,909 --> 00:20:16,909
Anna teaches the children and becomes romanced by the King.

4
00:26:54,545 --> 00:27:00,545
She convinces him that a man can be loved by just one woman.

5
00:33:38,181 --> 00:33:44,181
Anna, played by Jodie Foster.

6
00:40:21,818 --> 00:40:27,818
King Mongkut, played by Chow Yun-Fat.

7
00:47:05,454 --> 00:47:11,454
Tuptim, played by Bai Ling.

8
00:53:49,090 --> 00:53:55,090
Louis, played by Tom Felton.

9
01:00:32,727 --> 01:00:38,727
The Kralahome, played by Syed Alwi.

10
01:07:16,363 --> 01:07:22,363
General Alak, played by Randall Duk Kim.

11
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:06,000
Anna and the King is a 1999 American biographical
period drama film directed by Andy Tennant.

12
01:20:43,636 --> 01:20:49,636
Steve Meerson and Peter Krikes loosely based their screenplay on the 1944 novel Anna and the King
of Siam, which gives a fictionalized account of the diaries of Anna Leonowens.

13
01:27:27,272 --> 01:27:33,272
It stars Jodie Foster as Leonowens, an English school teacher in Siam during the late 19th century,
who becomes the teacher of King Mongkut's (Chow Yun-fat) many children and wives.

14
01:34:10,909 --> 01:34:16,909
It was mostly shot in Malaysia, particularly in the
Penang, Ipoh and Langkawi regions.

15
01:40:54,545 --> 01:41:00,545
Anna and the King was released in the United States on
December 17, 1999, by 20th Century Fox.

16
01:47:38,181 --> 01:47:44,181
The film was subject to controversy when the Thai government deemed it historically inaccurate
and insulting to the royal family and banned its distribution in the country.

17
01:54:21,818 --> 01:54:27,818
It received mixed reviews from critics who praised the production values, costume
design, and musical score but criticised its screenplay and length.

18
02:01:05,454 --> 02:01:11,454
The film grossed $114 million worldwide, against its $92 million budget.

19
02:07:49,090 --> 02:07:55,090
It received two nominations at the 72nd Academy Awards:
Best Art Direction and Best Costume Design.

20
02:14:32,727 --> 02:14:38,727
The film explores themes of daughter, death penalty, civil
war, parent child relationship, traitor.

21
02:21:16,363 --> 02:21:22,363
The tone is emotional.
